00:08:03.457 --> 00:08:05.057
MARIA:  GOVERNOR, SET THE RECORD

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.403
STRAIGHT FOR US.

00:08:06.414 --> 00:08:08.780
WHO IS NOT GETTING TESTED AT THE

00:08:08.814 --> 00:08:10.343
BORDER AND ALSO WE DO HAVE

00:08:10.354 --> 00:08:12.399
BREAKING NEWS THIS MORNING, WE

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:14.055
HAVE THE LATEST UNOFFICIAL

00:08:14.066 --> 00:08:15.688
BORDER NUMBERS FROM OUR BORDER

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.387
SOURCES FOR THE MONTH OF

00:08:17.388 --> 00:08:18.856
NOVEMBER AND IT IS GETTING

00:08:18.857 --> 00:08:19.717
WORSE.

00:08:19.728 --> 00:08:24.650
WE HAD 168,000 APPREHENSIONS FOR

00:08:24.651 --> 00:08:27.625
THE MONTH AND 52,429 GOT-AWAYS,

00:08:27.626 --> 00:08:29.650
IN OTHER WORDS, THOSE PEOPLE

00:08:29.661 --> 00:08:31.443
CAME INTO THE COUNTRY, SEEN ON

00:08:31.454 --> 00:08:32.240
SURVEILLANCE CAMERAS, THEY GOT

00:08:32.251 --> 00:08:33.042
AWAY.

00:08:33.076 --> 00:08:35.896
WE ARE LOOKING AT 600,000

00:08:35.907 --> 00:08:37.426
GOT-AWAYS THIS FISCAL YEAR, UP

00:08:37.437 --> 00:08:38.147
40%.

00:08:38.181 --> 00:08:40.678
YOUR THOUGHTS ON TESTING FOR

00:08:40.679 --> 00:08:43.957
COVID AND ALL OF THIS IMPACT OF

00:08:43.959 --> 00:08:46.708
THE WIDE OPEN BORDER IN TEXAS.

00:08:46.719 --> 00:08:48.662
&gt;&gt;  MARIA, I’M UNAWARE WHETHER

00:08:48.696 --> 00:08:50.266
OR NOT DR. FAUCI HAS EVER

00:08:50.277 --> 00:08:51.840
ACTUALLY BEEN TO THE BORDER.

00:08:51.851 --> 00:08:53.481
CERTAINLY DURING THE TIME OF

00:08:53.492 --> 00:08:56.075
COVID, I DON’T THINK HE HAS ANY

00:08:56.086 --> 00:08:56.887
PERSONAL FIRSTHAND KNOWLEDGE

00:08:56.898 --> 00:08:59.261
WHETHER OR NOT PEOPLE ARE BEING

00:08:59.294 --> 00:09:01.296
TESTED COMING ACROSS THE BORDER.

00:09:01.307 --> 00:09:03.135
I, HOWEVER, AM ON THE BORDER

00:09:03.169 --> 00:09:04.590
EITHER EVERY WEEK OR EVERY OTHER

00:09:04.601 --> 00:09:06.035
WEEK AND I’VE BEEN DEALING WITH

00:09:06.068 --> 00:09:07.625
AND TALKING TO BORDER PATROL AS

00:09:07.636 --> 00:09:09.131
WELL AS THE TEXAS NATIONAL GUARD

00:09:09.165 --> 00:09:10.672
AND THE TEXAS DEPARTMENT OF

00:09:10.683 --> 00:09:11.722
PUBLIC SAFETY WHO ARE

00:09:11.733 --> 00:09:12.821
APPREHENDING THESE PEOPLE COMING

00:09:12.832 --> 00:09:14.325
ACROSS THE BORDER AND WHAT I CAN

00:09:14.336 --> 00:09:16.708
TELL YOU FOR A FACT IS MOST OF

00:09:16.719 --> 00:09:18.088
THE PEOPLE COMING ACROSS THE

00:09:18.099 --> 00:09:19.516
BORDER, IF NOT ALL OF THEM, ARE

00:09:19.527 --> 00:09:21.111
NOT BEING TESTED.

00:09:21.144 --> 00:09:22.995
THE POINT IS THIS.

00:09:23.006 --> 00:09:24.804
THE PRESIDENT AND THE BIDEN

00:09:24.815 --> 00:09:25.773
ADMINISTRATION, THEY HAVE TWO

00:09:25.784 --> 00:09:26.129
STANDARDS.

00:09:26.163 --> 00:09:28.260
IF YOU’RE GOING TO PAY MONEY TO

00:09:28.271 --> 00:09:30.019
COME INTO THE UNITED STATES OF

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.294
AMERICA LAWFULLY, YOU HAVE TO BE

00:09:31.305 --> 00:09:31.637
TESTED.

00:09:31.648 --> 00:09:33.211
HOWEVER, IF YOU COME INTO THE

00:09:33.222 --> 00:09:34.238
COUNTRY ILLEGALLY, YOU DON’T

00:09:34.272 --> 00:09:35.677
HAVE TO BE TESTED.

00:09:35.688 --> 00:09:37.431
AS YOU KNOW, THE NUMBERS, THERE

00:09:37.442 --> 00:09:39.648
HAVE BEEN MORE THAN A MILLION

00:09:39.683 --> 00:09:41.476
PEOPLE WHO HAVE COME ACROSS THE

00:09:41.487 --> 00:09:42.878
BORDER ILLEGALLY THAT WE KNOW OF

00:09:42.889 --> 00:09:43.719
THIS YEAR.

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:45.192
MOST OF WHOM HAVE NOT BEEN

00:09:45.203 --> 00:09:45.709
TESTED.

00:09:45.711 --> 00:09:47.733
SO THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION

00:09:47.744 --> 00:09:49.124
ACTUALLY HAS NO ADEQUATE

00:09:49.135 --> 00:09:50.259
INFORMATION TO DETERMINE THE

00:09:50.293 --> 00:09:52.307
EXTENT TO WHICH PEOPLE ARE

00:09:52.318 --> 00:09:53.940
COMING ACROSS THE BORDER BY THE

00:09:53.951 --> 00:09:55.997
MILLIONS TO KNOW WHETHER OR NOT

00:09:56.008 --> 00:09:57.730
THEY ARE BRINGING COVID OR THE

00:09:57.763 --> 00:09:58.748
OMICRON VARIANT, WHATEVER THE

00:09:58.759 --> 00:10:00.182
CASE MAY BE, INTO THE UNITED

00:10:00.184 --> 00:10:01.888
STATES OF AMERICA.

00:10:01.899 --> 00:10:03.715
THAT IS COMPLETELY IRRESPONSIBLE

00:10:03.726 --> 00:10:05.327
AND EXTREMELY DANGEROUS.

00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:06.715
YOU TALKED ABOUT --

00:10:06.726 --> 00:10:08.172
MARIA:  ABSOLUTELY.

00:10:08.183 --> 00:10:11.672
&gt;&gt;  THE GOT-AWAYS, THE REASON WE

00:10:11.706 --> 00:10:13.310
HAVE GOT-AWAYS, IT’S BECAUSE THE

00:10:13.311 --> 00:10:14.878
BIDEN ADMINISTRATION HAS TIED

00:10:14.879 --> 00:10:16.395
THE HANDS OF BORDER PATROL AND

00:10:16.396 --> 00:10:17.205
I.C.E.

00:10:17.206 --> 00:10:19.654
THEY HAVE INSUFFICIENT NUMBERS

00:10:19.665 --> 00:10:21.858
TO SECURE THE BORDER.

00:10:21.891 --> 00:10:24.139
THESE WHY TEXAS HAS 10,000

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.556
NATIONAL GUARD AND DEPARTMENT OF

00:10:25.557 --> 00:10:27.197
PUBLIC SAFETY OFFICERS ON THE

00:10:27.208 --> 00:10:29.574
BORDER, THAT’S WHY WE’RE

00:10:29.585 --> 00:10:31.691
ERECTING BARRIERS ON THE BORDER,

00:10:31.702 --> 00:10:33.188
IT’S WHY TEXAS IS BUILDING ITS

00:10:33.199 --> 00:10:33.949
OWN BORDER WALL.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:34.818
MARIA:  EXACTLY.

00:10:34.829 --> 00:10:37.346
ONE OF MY SOURCES TOLD ME ABOUT

00:10:37.357 --> 00:10:38.283
THE LAWLESSNESS HAPPENING IN

00:10:38.294 --> 00:10:38.874
HOUSTON.

00:10:38.907 --> 00:10:42.135
HE TOLD ME THERE WERE 400,000

00:10:42.136 --> 00:10:45.172
NEW PEOPLE IN HOUSTON RIGHT NOW

00:10:45.183 --> 00:10:46.988
BECAUSE THERE ARE GET-AWAY CARS

00:10:46.999 --> 00:10:48.630
PICKING THEM UP FROM THE BORDER,

00:10:48.641 --> 00:10:49.794
DRIVING THEM TO HOUSTON.

00:10:49.805 --> 00:10:51.465
I WAS TOLD ONE OF THE BIGGEST

00:10:51.499 --> 00:10:53.723
BUSINESSES IN HOUSTON RIGHT NOW

00:10:53.734 --> 00:10:55.419
IS PRODUCING FAKE DOCUMENTS.

00:10:55.453 --> 00:10:57.028
THAT THESE COMPANIES THAT

00:10:57.039 --> 00:10:58.962
PRODUCE FAKE DOCUMENTS FOR THESE

00:10:58.997 --> 00:11:00.264
ILLEGALS ARE JUST SOARING.

00:11:00.275 --> 00:11:02.619
WHAT’S GOING ON IN HOUSTON AND

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:05.696
BY THE WAY, A FEDERAL JUDGE IS

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:06.927
INSISTING THAT THE BIDEN

00:11:06.938 --> 00:11:07.619
ADMINISTRATION REIMPLEMENT

00:11:07.653 --> 00:11:10.036
REMAIN IN MEXICO BUT MY SOURCES

00:11:10.047 --> 00:11:12.045
ON THE GROUND SAID I’LL BELIEVE

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.714
IT WHEN I SEE IT.

00:11:13.725 --> 00:11:15.565
THEY STILL THINK THEY’RE GOING

00:11:15.576 --> 00:11:16.646
TO BLOW-OFF THE LAW.

00:11:16.681 --> 00:11:18.126
YOUR THOUGHTS ON WHAT’S GOING ON

00:11:18.137 --> 00:11:20.110
IN HOUSTON AS WELL AS THE RIEU

00:11:20.121 --> 00:11:21.463
MAIN IN MEXICO POLICY.

00:11:21.474 --> 00:11:24.797
&gt;&gt;  THE REMAIN IN MEXICO, THAT

00:11:24.831 --> 00:11:26.848
WAS A RESULT OF A LAWSUIT WHERE

00:11:26.859 --> 00:11:28.526
A FEDERAL JUDGE RULED IN OUR

00:11:28.537 --> 00:11:30.033
FAVOR COMPELLING THE BIDEN

00:11:30.044 --> 00:11:31.671
ADMINISTRATION TO REINSTATE THE

00:11:31.682 --> 00:11:33.078
REMAIN IN MEXICO POLICY.

00:11:33.089 --> 00:11:35.528
WE ARE APPREHENSIVE ABOUT THE

00:11:35.529 --> 00:11:38.171
EXTENT TO WHICH THE BUY BEN BIDE

00:11:38.182 --> 00:11:39.550
ADMINISTRATION WILL REIMPOSE IT.

00:11:39.584 --> 00:11:41.168
THE NEWS REPORTS ARE THEY’RE

00:11:41.179 --> 00:11:42.611
GOING TO BEGIN DOING IT.

00:11:42.622 --> 00:11:43.858
I THINK THEY’VE GOTTEN AGREEMENT

00:11:43.893 --> 00:11:45.049
BY THE MEXICAN GOVERNMENT TO

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:46.627
BEGIN THE PROCESS, BEGINNING

00:11:46.628 --> 00:11:48.453
THIS WEEKEND, EARLY NEXT WEEK.

00:11:48.454 --> 00:11:50.162
BUT OF COURSE AS USUAL, WE’LL

00:11:50.163 --> 00:11:52.235
BELIEVE IT WHEN WE SEE IT.

00:11:52.246 --> 00:11:54.227
WITH REGARD TO THESE CRIMES THAT

00:11:54.261 --> 00:11:55.486
YOU’RE TALKING ABOUT TAKING

00:11:55.497 --> 00:11:56.710
PLACE, LISTEN, THIS IS PART OF

00:11:56.721 --> 00:11:57.957
CARTEL ACTIVITY.

00:11:57.968 --> 00:12:00.662
THE CARTELS ARE ADVERTISING ON

00:12:00.673 --> 00:12:03.266
TIKTOK TO GET DRIVERS TO ASSIST

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.519
AND THEN MOVING ILLEGAL

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:05.634
IMMIGRANTS AROUND THE STATE OF

00:12:05.645 --> 00:12:06.466
TECHS AS.

00:12:06.501 --> 00:12:08.666
IT’S AN ISSUE THAT THE TEXAS

00:12:08.667 --> 00:12:10.180
DEPARTMENT OF PUBLIC SAFETY IS

00:12:10.181 --> 00:12:11.582
WORKING TO CRACK DOWN UPON.

00:12:11.593 --> 00:12:13.118
IT SHOWS THE EXTENT TO WHICH

00:12:13.129 --> 00:12:14.263
TEXAS LAW ENFORCEMENT OFFICERS

00:12:14.274 --> 00:12:16.083
HAVE TO STEP UP AND DEAL WITH

00:12:16.094 --> 00:12:17.834
THE CHALLENGES THAT A ARE

00:12:17.845 --> 00:12:19.339
CREATED BY THE BIDEN

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:20.448
ADMINISTRATION IMPORTING ILLEGAL

00:12:20.459 --> 00:12:21.733
ACTIVITY INTO OUR COUNTRY AND

00:12:21.767 --> 00:12:22.968
INTO OUR STATE.

00:12:22.979 --> 00:12:24.355
MARIA:  YEAH.

00:12:24.366 --> 00:12:26.018
WELL, WE WILL LEAVE IT THERE.

00:12:26.029 --> 00:12:27.234
GOVERNOR, THANKS VERY MUCH FOR

00:12:27.245 --> 00:12:27.675
YOUR LEADERSHIP.

00:12:27.709 --> 00:12:28.634
GOOD TO TALK WITH YOU THIS

00:12:28.645 --> 00:12:28.972
MORNING.

00:12:29.006 --> 00:12:29.255
WE HAVE REPORTED ON THE TIKTOK

